 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "This is the family history of Esau",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He is Edom in the hill country of Seir",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Esau took his wives from the daughters of Canaan",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Adah and Oholibamah and Basemath came",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Their possessions were too great to live together",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The land could not support their livestock there",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.59,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "So Esau moved away from his brother Jacob",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 4.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And settled in the land that bears his name",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 6.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "When Shaul died, Baal-Hanan son of Achbor succeeded him as king",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 1.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "When Baal-Hanan died, Hadar succeeded him as king",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 3.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "His city was named Pau, his wife Mehetabel",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 4.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Daughter of Matred, daughter of Me-Zahab",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 19.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Before any king reigned over the Israelites",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 2.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "There were kings who reigned in the land of Edom",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 2.8,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Shaul from Rehoboth on the River succeeded Samlah",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then Baal-Hanan took the throne in his place",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 2.98,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The list continues in the books of Chronicles",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 2.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Hadar reigned in his place, his city was named Pai",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Mehetabel was his wife, daughter of Matred",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The line of Esau grew in the hill country of Seir",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 1.9,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "When Shaul died, Baal-Hanan son of Achbor succeeded him as king",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 2.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "When Baal-Hanan died, Hadar succeeded him as king",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 2.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "His city was named Pau, his wife Mehetabel",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Daughter of Matred, daughter of Me-Zahab",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 2.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "This is the family history of Esau",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 5.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
